  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-24T22:57:08.072Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This has been happening to me and a friend constantly ever since we started playing VRchat on our Quests:\nAbout 50% of the times we change world, it freezes in the process of downloading the world, and the only way out of it is to return to home. It's also happened to us a few times when returning to the home, then we have to restart VRchat.\nIt's not the WiFi, as we both have good quality fast WiFi in completely different locations.\nThis is kind of a game breaking bug, please could it be fixed?",
